1. Methods reimplemented with credit
-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The feature extraction and peak picking of the detector (crates/core/src/detect/) are an
independent Rust implementation that reproduces the processing of madmom (Sebastian
Boeck, Filip Korzeniowski, Jan Schlueter, Florian Krebs, Gerhard Widmer, "madmom: a new
Python Audio and Music Signal Processing Library", Proceedings of the 24th ACM
International Conference on Multimedia, 2016; https://github.com/CPJKU/madmom).
No source code of madmom is part of this repository.

